 "En lugar de fijar los acoplamientos gL y gR, introducimos el cociente   ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"r", " ", "=", " ", 
    FractionBox[
     SuperscriptBox[
      SubscriptBox["g", "R"], "2"], 
     SuperscriptBox[
      SubscriptBox["g", "L"], "2"]]}], TraditionalForm]],
  InitializationCell->True,
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "153f4f2f-8431-44c0-8de1-54f06cd23c73"],
 ", de manera que "
}], "Text",
